tools/setup_export_runtime.py verifies pinned npm SHA-512 integrity before
extracting the unmodified modules, original LICENSE files and READMEs under
ignored web/play/vendor/. Exact integrity, bytes and SHA-256 hashes are in
web/play/vendor/export-runtime.json. They are included in a static build with
their licenses. These upstream packages are deprecated in favor of Mediabunny;
this app uses the pinned container muxers only and does not bundle Mediabunny.
